  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $x \\in A \\cap B$. Then,\r\n$x \\in A$ and $x \\in B$\r\n$\\Rightarrow x$ is a multiple of 4 and $x$ is a multiple of 6\r\n$\\Rightarrow x$ is a multiple of 4 and 6 both\r\n$\\therefore x$ is a multiple of 12",
